==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
This Outbreak is easily rushed by spamming [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] from the start. One can bring Attack Up Combos or other rushers such as [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] or [[Cutter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Neo Cutter Cat]] to clear this already easy stage even faster.

==='''Chapter 2'''===
Like with Chapter 1, this stage is also pretty easy to rush, as the main threats appear after 50 seconds. Bring Worker Cat Start Level Combos to start. Use [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cats]] to rush down the starting One Horns, along with some high-speed meatshields like [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cat]] or [[Talents|Talented]] [[Pogo Cat (Rare Cat)|Jiangshi Cat]] to keep LeMurr away. As soon as the first One Horn goes down, send out your Talented [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to eviscerate everything.

